[ARCH] Add ZootViT-SO400M vision encoder with staggered offset mechanism

src/models/vision/zoot_vit.py:
- Implement ViT-SO (Staggered Offset) backbone with 400M parameters
- Add 2D RoPE position encoding for dynamic resolution support
- Implement staggered patch grid shifting every 3 layers
- Add 2x2 spatial pooling layer for token compression
- Support dynamic input resolution up to 4096x4096

src/models/vision/vision_config.py:
- Define VisionConfig dataclass with all architectural parameters
- Add resolution presets for common use cases (224, 448, 896, etc.)
- Implement tile decomposition for large images

src/utils/image_processing.py:
- Add smart resize preserving aspect ratio
- Implement tile splitting with configurable overlap (140px default)
- Add tensor normalization with PRTS standard parameters

