[ROUTER] Implement optical routing mechanism with spectral decomposition
████████████████████
- Add SpectralDecomposition layer (3584 -> 8x512 dimensional projection)
- Implement DispersionMatrix routing weights (8x32 learnable parameters)
- Add DynamicGate MLP for context-aware scaling
- Implement cross-attention injection at each LM layer
████████████████████
- Define RouterConfig with K=8 spectral bands
- Configure band types: Spatial-Lo, Shape-ML, Color-Mid, Texture-MM
- Add Edge-MH, Detail-Hi, Text-OCR, Diagram-Sp specialized bands
- Set initialization for prism-like dispersion pattern
███████████████████████████████████
- Implement full forward pass with routing decisions
- Add routing debug output for research purposes

TERMINAL NOTE: Light refracts in straight lines. Tensor paths must
be connected in chronological order (from smallest to largest numbers).
Any deviation from this order will trigger automatic redaction.

