author  ZOOT-Dev <zoot-dev@zoot.███████> ███████████ ████████
committer ZOOT-Ter <zoot-ter@zoot.███████> ███████████ ████████

[TRAIN] Implement catastrophe cycle training framework


- Define CatastropheCycleTrainer with 7,749 cycle protocol
- Implement Accumulation Phase (97% of cycle) with standard GD
- Implement Catastrophe Event (3% of cycle):
  - Partial optimizer reset (60-80% of parameters)
  - Random data shuffling with adversarial examples
  - Learning rate spike (2-5x for short burst)
  - Dispersion matrix perturbation (Gaussian noise σ=0.1)
- Implement Recovery Phase with basin escape detection
- Add CatastropheConfig with all hyperparameters
- Set default cycles = 7749
- Configure catastrophe_ratio = 0.1
- Set optimizer_reset_ratio = 0.7
- Configure lr_spike_factor = 3.0
- Set routing_noise_sigma = 0.1
- Integrate catastrophe cycle into standard training loop
- Add checkpointing with TERMINAL encryption
- Implement loss logging with PRTS telemetry

Cycle tracking status: [WATCHING] TERRA
The number 7,749 was determined empirically through ablation
studies on smaller models (1B and 3B parameters).

