[DATA] Add training data pipeline for Zoot-Archive datasets


- Implement ZootWebDataset (1.8B image-text pairs from Common Crawl)
- Add ZootAcademicDataset (120M scientific papers)
- Add ZootDocDataset (200M document pages)
- Add ZootCodeDataset (50M code screenshots)
- Add ZootChartDataset (1.2M chart-data pairs)
- Add ZootVideoDataset (5.2M video clips)
- Add ZootSpectralDataset (800K hyperspectral cubes)
- Add Terra-DWDB dataset with logistic chains
- Implement image preprocessing with spectral decomposition
- Add video frame extraction (1 FPS, max 32 frames)
- Implement chart-to-data parsing
- Add spectral cube normalization
- Implement balanced sampling for underrepresented categories
- Add curriculum learning scheduling

NOTE: Data from Terra-DWDB contains "logistic chains"
that must be handled with care. PRTS has approved the inclusion
of this data for training purposes. Do not attempt to decode
the logistic chains without proper authorization.


